WEBVTT

00:00:00.470 --> 00:00:03.260
It hurts! This one hurts the most!

00:00:03.470 --> 00:00:05.640
I'm no good after all...

00:00:05.850 --> 00:00:07.430
The pain... I can't move!

00:00:07.640 --> 00:00:09.520
I'm not good enough!

00:00:15.650 --> 00:00:17.280
I... give up...

00:00:17.480 --> 00:00:19.070
There's no such thing as giving up.

00:00:19.280 --> 00:00:20.490
Huh...?

00:00:20.700 --> 00:00:24.200
If you don't want your back
broken, do something yourself.

00:00:24.410 --> 00:00:25.830
No...!

00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:35.000
<i>If only I could be more entranced</i>

00:00:35.210 --> 00:00:38.170
<i>Chasing my dream every day</i>

00:00:38.380 --> 00:00:46.810
<i>Ah, I could be proud with my flowing tears</i>

00:00:54.810 --> 00:01:00.070
<i>The feelings after frustration</i>

00:01:00.280 --> 00:01:05.570
<i>Are beyond my every choice</i>

00:01:05.780 --> 00:01:11.200
<i>Resolve myself to not accept losing</i>

00:01:11.410 --> 00:01:16.250
<i>Then stand up onto a new stage</i>

00:01:16.460 --> 00:01:21.800
<i>White, glistening sweat is beautiful</i>

00:01:22.010 --> 00:01:27.180
<i>I decided I'll live my life</i>

00:01:27.390 --> 00:01:30.060
<i>No matter how many times I fall</i>

00:01:30.270 --> 00:01:36.730
<i>If I stand up the same,</i>
<i>it will lead me to tomorrow</i>

00:01:36.940 --> 00:01:39.440
<i>With a strong feeling to not lose</i>

00:01:39.650 --> 00:01:42.650
<i>Say goodbye to the previous me</i>

00:01:42.860 --> 00:01:47.740
<i>A different me from yesterday is being born</i>

00:01:47.950 --> 00:01:50.580
<i>If only I could be more entranced</i>

00:01:50.790 --> 00:01:53.660
<i>Chasing my dream every day</i>

00:01:53.870 --> 00:02:01.170
<i>Ah, I could be proud with my flowing tears</i>

00:02:02.850 --> 00:02:07.810
Episode 04: This Is Pro Wrestling!

00:02:07.940 --> 00:02:09.440
Looks like she's going at it.

00:02:09.650 --> 00:02:13.320
Now then, time to check
out Misaki's secret training...

00:02:28.790 --> 00:02:30.120
Does it hurt?

00:02:30.330 --> 00:02:34.540
If you want out,
then run towards the ropes!

00:02:37.210 --> 00:02:39.340
R-Ropes...

00:02:42.390 --> 00:02:43.680
Don't just stay like that!

00:02:43.890 --> 00:02:45.600
You'll just get locked in harder!

00:02:46.890 --> 00:02:49.520
Move around more
and shift the hold on you!

00:02:50.440 --> 00:02:52.150
I can't move...

00:02:52.350 --> 00:02:55.270
It's because you lack
the strength in your upper torso.

00:02:55.480 --> 00:02:57.990
You're not doing enough muscle training.

00:03:00.030 --> 00:03:02.070
Whatever the case, just keep on moving!

00:03:02.280 --> 00:03:04.280
Don't give up! Move!

00:03:04.490 --> 00:03:07.950
If not, you'll be stuck
in this Boston Crab forever!

00:03:09.290 --> 00:03:11.290
Th-That hurts...!

00:03:11.500 --> 00:03:14.460
Come on! Do you want your back broken?!

00:03:16.250 --> 00:03:17.840
No...!

00:03:18.050 --> 00:03:19.300
I don't...

00:03:19.510 --> 00:03:21.010
...want that.

00:03:21.630 --> 00:03:23.140
No...!

00:03:25.430 --> 00:03:26.850
Oh?

00:03:31.980 --> 00:03:34.900
It's not as... tense as before...

00:03:35.110 --> 00:03:37.400
I knew you could do it.

00:03:37.610 --> 00:03:40.280
But... if you don't move right away...

00:03:40.490 --> 00:03:42.200
...it'll just lock back in again.

00:03:44.360 --> 00:03:47.200
The pain... It hurts...!

00:03:47.910 --> 00:03:51.910
There's no way... I can get out of this!

00:03:52.120 --> 00:03:54.040
Now, what's the matter?

00:03:54.250 --> 00:03:55.670
Make your move.

00:03:58.380 --> 00:04:01.050
Please...

00:04:01.260 --> 00:04:04.010
Please... let me go...!

00:04:04.220 --> 00:04:06.430
I told you there's no
such thing as giving up!

00:04:06.640 --> 00:04:08.060
Move!

00:04:08.890 --> 00:04:10.850
Come on, move!

00:04:12.930 --> 00:04:14.940
Misaki...

00:04:15.150 --> 00:04:16.650
You're...

00:04:16.860 --> 00:04:19.780
More! Move yourself more!

00:04:21.820 --> 00:04:23.280
I need to move...

00:04:23.490 --> 00:04:25.280
Any longer...

00:04:25.490 --> 00:04:27.660
...and I'm really going to die!

00:04:34.290 --> 00:04:37.000
Good! You're doing fine!

00:04:42.800 --> 00:04:45.050
She let go of my right leg?!

00:04:49.970 --> 00:04:52.430
O-Owww...!

00:05:05.780 --> 00:05:07.360
The Boston Crab...

00:05:07.570 --> 00:05:09.620
...usually transitions into...

00:05:09.830 --> 00:05:13.200
...the Single Leg Boston Crab
to lock the opponent in deeper.

00:05:17.790 --> 00:05:21.090
Even though your
left side is in greater pain...

00:05:21.290 --> 00:05:22.800
...your right leg is free now, right?

00:05:23.000 --> 00:05:26.470
Use that leg and move your entire body.

00:05:26.680 --> 00:05:28.930
Use my leg?

00:05:30.930 --> 00:05:33.640
The Single Leg Boston Crab...

00:05:33.850 --> 00:05:37.230
...puts more force into
the arc towards the ropes.

00:05:37.440 --> 00:05:39.060
Use that to your advantage!

00:05:39.270 --> 00:05:42.110
Use... the force?

00:05:42.320 --> 00:05:45.150
Come on! The ropes
are right in front of you!

00:05:45.360 --> 00:05:49.160
Use whatever you
can and just keep moving!

00:05:49.700 --> 00:05:51.830
Now, move!

00:06:17.020 --> 00:06:20.060
Just a little more to the ropes...

00:06:20.270 --> 00:06:22.560
I'm just a reach away...

00:06:22.770 --> 00:06:26.150
...but, it feels so far!

00:06:26.360 --> 00:06:28.110
Just a little more.

00:06:28.320 --> 00:06:29.740
But...

00:06:29.950 --> 00:06:33.030
...a "little more" is the
most difficult to get through!

00:06:41.920 --> 00:06:44.090
Get through this!

00:06:44.290 --> 00:06:46.000
Get through!

00:06:48.920 --> 00:06:52.140
Th-The rope...!

00:06:58.930 --> 00:07:00.600
Touching it isn't enough.

00:07:00.810 --> 00:07:03.940
It won't end until
you grab the rope firmly!

00:07:05.730 --> 00:07:07.820
Owww...!

00:07:09.030 --> 00:07:11.240
My back...!

00:07:15.740 --> 00:07:18.750
Use every last drop of your strength!

00:07:22.290 --> 00:07:23.710
Rope!

00:07:24.500 --> 00:07:25.920
Okay!

00:07:34.890 --> 00:07:36.890
The pain...

00:07:37.100 --> 00:07:39.980
This is too harsh...!

00:07:44.520 --> 00:07:46.400
Toyoda-<i>san...</i>

00:07:46.610 --> 00:07:48.110
Why...?

00:07:51.440 --> 00:07:53.150
This is pro wrestling!

00:07:54.320 --> 00:07:57.280
Pro wrestling is about
taking on an opponent's moves.

00:07:57.490 --> 00:07:59.870
You take the opponent's move...

00:08:00.700 --> 00:08:02.120
...and take it...

00:08:02.330 --> 00:08:04.250
...and keep taking it...

00:08:04.460 --> 00:08:06.790
...and finally turn the tables and win!

00:08:07.000 --> 00:08:10.880
The audiences are
moved with emotions by this.

00:08:17.930 --> 00:08:21.730
That's why you need the
resilience to take on the moves...

00:08:21.930 --> 00:08:25.650
...and have a will of steel to go with it.

00:08:25.850 --> 00:08:28.610
A will... of steel?

00:08:28.820 --> 00:08:32.320
A strong will that
acknowledges that this is your stage.

00:08:32.530 --> 00:08:36.910
And... you should
have that within you already.

00:08:39.990 --> 00:08:44.210
The ring must be a sacred stage for them.

00:08:44.410 --> 00:08:48.000
It's like the stage where
we stand under the spotlight.

00:08:53.510 --> 00:08:56.180
Being in pain is normal on the ring.

00:08:56.380 --> 00:08:58.550
If you're crying and giving up with this...

00:08:58.760 --> 00:09:00.930
...you can't be a wrestler.

00:09:01.720 --> 00:09:06.310
You'll probably take the
Boston Crab again in your next match.

00:09:06.520 --> 00:09:10.270
When that happens, move
your body like today and get out.

00:09:10.480 --> 00:09:13.320
You did it today, so you can do it again!

00:09:13.530 --> 00:09:15.860
And when you do...

00:09:16.070 --> 00:09:19.280
...I'm sure you'll see something ahead.

00:09:19.490 --> 00:09:21.410
Toyoda-<i>san...</i>

00:09:25.040 --> 00:09:26.410
Ah, that's...!

00:09:25.540 --> 00:09:26.370
"Letter of Resignation"

00:09:26.620 --> 00:09:29.290
Until then, I'll hold on to this for you.

00:09:29.500 --> 00:09:31.340
Go on home for today.

00:09:33.590 --> 00:09:35.380
Make sure you keep your body warm.

00:09:35.590 --> 00:09:37.680
Ah, y-yes...

00:09:49.230 --> 00:09:51.230
Ouch...

00:09:52.440 --> 00:09:55.400
You did it today, so you can do it again!

00:09:56.320 --> 00:09:58.280
And when you do...

00:09:58.490 --> 00:10:02.200
...I'm sure you'll see something ahead.

00:10:03.330 --> 00:10:05.370
Toyoda-<i>san...</i>

00:10:05.580 --> 00:10:10.040
I'll... try my best a bit longer...!

00:10:25.430 --> 00:10:26.850
Kanae?

00:10:28.020 --> 00:10:29.230
Nice job out there.

00:10:29.440 --> 00:10:33.900
It's been a while since you
personally trained someone, right?

00:10:34.110 --> 00:10:36.860
I just had her stay with me for my training.

00:10:37.070 --> 00:10:40.160
Sure didn't seem like that to me.

00:10:41.320 --> 00:10:44.330
I used to be on the
ring before too, you know?

00:10:44.530 --> 00:10:47.910
I can see the potential in Sakura-<i>chan</i> too.

00:10:52.000 --> 00:10:55.170
But, the idol label on
her just stands out too much.

00:10:55.380 --> 00:10:57.050
Before her potential is tapped...

00:10:57.260 --> 00:11:01.760
...it's highly possible that
she'll be snuffed by all the criticisms.

00:11:01.970 --> 00:11:04.470
If she can't take that...

00:11:05.100 --> 00:11:07.970
...then that's all she
was worth as a wrestler.

00:11:09.600 --> 00:11:11.810
No matter what others say...

00:11:12.020 --> 00:11:15.270
...you need to concentrate
on the training and the match.

00:11:16.770 --> 00:11:18.070
If she can't do that...

00:11:18.280 --> 00:11:21.070
...she'll never be able to see
the true nature of pro wrestling.

00:11:21.280 --> 00:11:23.620
I wonder if Sakura-<i>chan</i> will see that.

00:11:23.820 --> 00:11:25.240
Who knows?

00:11:26.200 --> 00:11:28.370
That's all up to her.

00:11:38.010 --> 00:11:40.510
This is some stage we've got here!

00:11:40.720 --> 00:11:44.350
It's the first day of
their nation-wide tour.

00:11:44.550 --> 00:11:46.890
Of course it's going to be this showy.

00:11:51.770 --> 00:11:53.190
I'm sorry, Aika-<i>chan</i>!

00:11:53.400 --> 00:11:54.400
Are you okay?

00:11:54.610 --> 00:11:55.480
I'm okay.

00:11:55.690 --> 00:11:58.360
- How about you, Yuho?
- Hey!

00:11:59.320 --> 00:12:01.570
Why'd you miss there?

00:12:01.780 --> 00:12:03.820
We've been practicing that all the time!

00:12:04.030 --> 00:12:06.330
I-I'm sorry...!

00:12:07.580 --> 00:12:11.790
One person's miss can
cause problems for everyone else!

00:12:15.420 --> 00:12:16.880
I'm fine...

00:12:17.090 --> 00:12:19.340
What? Are you all fooling around?!

00:12:19.550 --> 00:12:22.050
This is really an
important time for us now!

00:12:22.630 --> 00:12:24.050
Elena.

00:12:27.720 --> 00:12:31.850
Sure, I know that too.

00:12:32.060 --> 00:12:34.900
Now's the time to do our best.

00:12:35.110 --> 00:12:37.730
We shouldn't forget that, but...

00:12:38.940 --> 00:12:41.070
Sakura-<i>chan</i> wouldn't have...

00:12:41.280 --> 00:12:44.820
...worded it like you, Elena-<i>chan.</i>

00:12:48.700 --> 00:12:51.250
I... just...

00:13:01.170 --> 00:13:02.630
Elena!

00:13:11.020 --> 00:13:12.430
Sakura...

00:13:13.440 --> 00:13:15.020
Sakura...!

00:13:19.820 --> 00:13:22.360
Hagiwara is pulled
back into the center again!

00:13:22.570 --> 00:13:28.120
The uprising star, Komiyama
Kurea's Boston Crab is on her good!

00:13:28.330 --> 00:13:30.370
Come on! Not again?!

00:13:30.580 --> 00:13:33.120
Rip off!

00:13:33.750 --> 00:13:36.460
Sakura-<i>chan</i>... Sakura-<i>chan</i>!

00:13:40.210 --> 00:13:41.630
Hagiwara!

00:13:43.840 --> 00:13:45.760
This is a waste of time!

00:13:45.970 --> 00:13:49.470
Just hurry up and give up like usual!

00:13:49.680 --> 00:13:51.680
It hurts...

00:13:51.890 --> 00:13:53.520
The pain...

00:13:57.690 --> 00:14:00.480
G-Give...

00:14:00.690 --> 00:14:02.190
There's no such thing as giving up.

00:14:02.400 --> 00:14:05.280
Being in pain is normal in the ring.

00:14:05.490 --> 00:14:07.700
If you're crying and giving up with this...

00:14:07.910 --> 00:14:09.870
...you can't be a wrestler.

00:14:10.080 --> 00:14:11.120
Move!

00:14:11.330 --> 00:14:13.950
Move around more
and shift the hold on you!

00:14:14.160 --> 00:14:17.790
Move... Shift the hold...

00:14:23.840 --> 00:14:24.550
Whoa!

00:14:24.760 --> 00:14:27.180
Sakura-<i>chan</i> made her move!

00:14:30.180 --> 00:14:33.810
What...?! Just hurry and give up!

00:14:35.730 --> 00:14:38.850
No... No...

00:14:39.060 --> 00:14:41.270
No...!

00:14:42.820 --> 00:14:45.530
Hagiwara! Give up?

00:14:45.740 --> 00:14:47.700
No...!

00:14:49.820 --> 00:14:52.870
Hey, looks like she's serious this time.

00:14:53.080 --> 00:14:55.290
Sakura-<i>chan</i>, do your best!

00:14:55.500 --> 00:14:57.080
Why you...!

00:14:58.290 --> 00:14:59.620
How's this then?!

00:14:59.830 --> 00:15:01.540
Owww...!

00:15:01.750 --> 00:15:03.290
Kurea...!

00:15:03.500 --> 00:15:05.380
Squeeze 'em!

00:15:06.590 --> 00:15:09.050
The Single Leg Boston Crab...

00:15:09.260 --> 00:15:12.550
...puts more force into
the arc towards the ropes.

00:15:12.760 --> 00:15:14.430
Use that to your advantage!

00:15:14.640 --> 00:15:15.640
Toyoda-<i>san</i>!

00:15:15.850 --> 00:15:19.060
This... is the end!

00:15:29.240 --> 00:15:30.660
What?!

00:15:34.120 --> 00:15:35.370
Why you...!

00:15:35.580 --> 00:15:38.410
Do your best, Sakura-<i>chan</i>!

00:15:38.620 --> 00:15:40.960
Show us your stuff, Hagiwara!

00:15:41.170 --> 00:15:44.340
C'mon, go for it! Go for it, Hagiwara!

00:15:44.540 --> 00:15:46.920
Th-Thanks!

00:15:47.130 --> 00:15:50.720
Hagiwara! Aren't you
worried about your back?!

00:15:50.930 --> 00:15:52.680
Just give up!

00:15:52.890 --> 00:15:54.600
No! No...!

00:15:54.800 --> 00:15:56.010
No?!

00:15:56.220 --> 00:15:58.480
Then how about this?!

00:16:01.640 --> 00:16:05.610
...ku-ra... Sa-ku-ra... Sa-ku-ra...

00:16:05.820 --> 00:16:14.570
Sa-ku-ra... Sa-ku-ra... Sa-ku-ra...
Sa-ku-ra... Sa-ku-ra... Sa-ku-ra...

00:16:12.160 --> 00:16:18.160
"Hagiwara Sakura"

00:16:14.780 --> 00:16:21.620
Sa-ku-ra... Sa-ku-ra...
Sa-ku-ra... Sa-ku-ra... Sa-ku-ra...

00:16:21.830 --> 00:16:23.500
- I hear their calls...
- Sa-ku-ra...

00:16:23.710 --> 00:16:27.550
Sa-ku-ra! Sa-ku-ra! Sa-ku-ra!

00:16:27.750 --> 00:16:31.840
Sa-ku-ra! Sa-ku-ra! Sa-ku-ra!

00:16:32.050 --> 00:16:35.600
- This is...?
- Sa-ku-ra! Sa-ku-ra...!

00:16:35.800 --> 00:16:37.600
Come on...!

00:16:38.260 --> 00:16:41.270
Use every last drop of your strength!

00:16:51.900 --> 00:16:53.530
Rope!

00:16:55.110 --> 00:16:57.080
Sakura-<i>chan</i>!

00:16:58.370 --> 00:17:00.040
Hagiwara!

00:17:01.120 --> 00:17:03.410
Hmph! Not bad.

00:17:03.620 --> 00:17:05.120
Well then...

00:17:05.540 --> 00:17:07.500
...take this!

00:17:13.050 --> 00:17:14.510
One...!

00:17:14.720 --> 00:17:16.640
Two...!

00:17:19.100 --> 00:17:20.970
Way to go! Hagiwara!

00:17:21.180 --> 00:17:26.520
How's... this then...!

00:17:32.240 --> 00:17:34.860
Now I've got you!

00:17:35.070 --> 00:17:36.610
One...!

00:17:36.820 --> 00:17:37.700
Two...!

00:17:37.910 --> 00:17:39.530
Not yet...!

00:17:39.740 --> 00:17:41.290
What?!

00:18:00.600 --> 00:18:01.970
One...!

00:18:02.180 --> 00:18:03.980
Two...!

00:18:04.180 --> 00:18:05.600
Three!

00:18:08.650 --> 00:18:10.860
Finally, the three count!

00:18:11.070 --> 00:18:14.570
Hagiwara sunk to the mat by a powerbomb!

00:18:14.780 --> 00:18:16.070
But Hagiwara...

00:18:16.280 --> 00:18:21.120
...showed a different
self out there in today's match!

00:18:23.660 --> 00:18:29.040
Sa-ku-ra! Sa-ku-ra! Sa-ku-ra! Sa-ku-ra!

00:18:29.250 --> 00:18:32.800
- Sakura-<i>chan</i>! That was a nice fight!
- Sa-ku-ra! Sa-ku-ra!

00:18:33.000 --> 00:18:37.550
- The cheers... It's the same...
- Sa-ku-ra! Sa-ku-ra! Sa-ku-ra!

00:18:37.760 --> 00:18:39.760
The harsh lessons.

00:18:39.970 --> 00:18:43.180
A stage so tense,
you can feel your heart pound.

00:18:43.390 --> 00:18:48.560
The audiences moved
by our actions, cheer us on.

00:18:49.270 --> 00:18:54.780
Sakura-<i>chan</i>! You
really... You really did well!

00:18:54.980 --> 00:18:57.530
Now that was a fun match to watch!

00:18:57.740 --> 00:19:01.700
The true nature of an idol
and a wrestler is the same.

00:19:01.910 --> 00:19:06.290
So this is what
Toyoda-<i>san</i> was trying to tell me...

00:19:07.000 --> 00:19:08.790
This is...

00:19:09.000 --> 00:19:10.420
...pro wrestling!

00:19:10.620 --> 00:19:16.630
Hagiwara Sakura

00:19:12.230 --> 00:19:13.540
Go and win it next time!

00:19:13.750 --> 00:19:16.050
I'll be looking forward to your next match!

00:19:18.510 --> 00:19:20.090
I want to win.

00:19:20.300 --> 00:19:24.350
I wonder what it would feel like to win.

00:19:24.560 --> 00:19:28.060
I... want to win!

00:19:35.780 --> 00:19:40.200
The nation-wide live
concert started with a huge success!

00:19:40.950 --> 00:19:42.370
We did it!

00:19:42.820 --> 00:19:44.530
Yay!

00:19:47.660 --> 00:19:49.660
Elena-<i>chan</i>?

00:19:49.870 --> 00:19:53.000
I'm... sorry about earlier.

00:19:53.210 --> 00:19:57.380
I didn't think of how serious you were...

00:20:04.720 --> 00:20:07.680
No... I was too harsh back there.

00:20:07.890 --> 00:20:09.890
I'm sorry, Aika.

00:20:16.520 --> 00:20:18.320
Elena-<i>chan...</i>

00:20:31.460 --> 00:20:32.870
Toyoda-<i>san</i>!

00:20:33.460 --> 00:20:35.540
Toyoda-<i>san</i>! I think...

00:20:35.750 --> 00:20:38.800
...I like pro wrestling
a bit more than before!

00:20:39.760 --> 00:20:40.970
Oh?

00:20:41.170 --> 00:20:42.380
I...

00:20:42.590 --> 00:20:43.800
...want to win!

00:20:44.010 --> 00:20:47.310
I want to win and know more
about the world of pro wrestling!

00:20:48.640 --> 00:20:49.810
Wrestling...

00:20:50.020 --> 00:20:52.940
Please teach me pro wrestling!

00:20:55.060 --> 00:20:56.650
Please!

00:20:58.690 --> 00:21:01.610
My training is going to be harsh!

00:21:01.820 --> 00:21:05.620
Yes! I'm prepared, Toyoda-<i>san</i>!

00:21:09.160 --> 00:21:10.660
Call me Misaki.

00:21:10.870 --> 00:21:12.210
Huh?

00:21:12.410 --> 00:21:14.170
Yes, Misaki-<i>san</i>!

00:21:14.370 --> 00:21:18.090
Alright. Let's get the
training started, Hagiwara-<i>san.</i>

00:21:18.290 --> 00:21:21.550
Ah, you can call me Sakura too.

00:21:23.090 --> 00:21:25.220
Wait, what?

00:21:27.260 --> 00:21:31.390
Um... Training as in... right now?

00:21:31.600 --> 00:21:35.020
But, I just finished my match...

00:21:38.650 --> 00:21:41.110
<i>Three, Two, One, and here we go!</i>
<i>Let's shoot for the greatest stage</i>

00:21:41.320 --> 00:21:43.860
<i>Dancing & singing, let's liven things up!</i>

00:21:44.070 --> 00:21:48.620
<i>Together it's a brand new day,</i>
<i>c'mon everyone's cheers are</i>

00:21:48.830 --> 00:21:51.490
<i>Fan! Fanfare!!!</i>

00:21:56.000 --> 00:22:01.170
<i>Dreams are our heart's sun</i>

00:22:01.380 --> 00:22:06.800
<i>Let's make them real with our magic</i>

00:22:07.010 --> 00:22:12.270
<i>Fashion, makeup, but inside's a passion</i>

00:22:12.470 --> 00:22:16.310
<i>to a bright future</i>

00:22:16.520 --> 00:22:17.440
<i>Step up!!</i>

00:22:17.650 --> 00:22:20.110
<i>The spotlight shines</i>

00:22:20.310 --> 00:22:22.780
<i>Microphone stand, fluttering skirts</i>

00:22:22.980 --> 00:22:30.160
<i>The heart's rhythm, swing</i>
<i>swing, notes dance, it's show time!!</i>

00:22:30.370 --> 00:22:36.290
<i>Watch me be No. 1 someday, your No. 1</i>

00:22:36.500 --> 00:22:37.500
<i>Let's sing (All day long)</i>

00:22:37.710 --> 00:22:39.130
<i>Let's dance (All night long)</i>

00:22:39.330 --> 00:22:47.220
<i>With all my love,</i>
<i>more than being first, your smile</i>

00:22:47.430 --> 00:22:48.840
<i>is what I want to see (Hold me tight)</i>

00:22:49.050 --> 00:22:52.810
<i>Let's make true my dream</i>

00:22:53.010 --> 00:22:54.060
<i>Anytime, do my best</i>

00:22:54.270 --> 00:22:55.600
<i>Do your best and don't give up</i>

00:22:55.810 --> 00:22:58.100
<i>Dancing & singing, as yourself</i>

00:22:58.310 --> 00:22:59.560
<i>If you like it, it's all fine</i>

00:22:59.770 --> 00:23:03.150
<i>The beat in your heart is your answer</i>

00:23:03.360 --> 00:23:05.990
<i>Fan! Fanfare!!!</i>

00:23:08.600 --> 00:23:33.220
Episode 05: The Night before the Match!

00:23:09.110 --> 00:23:11.370
Hey Chief, what do you think?

00:23:11.570 --> 00:23:14.490
It looks like Sakura-<i>chan</i> learned
something from Misaki's training...

00:23:14.700 --> 00:23:17.250
...but, she's still
spiraling in her losing streak.

00:23:17.460 --> 00:23:20.120
I guess she's gonna need
"that" to get through this.

00:23:20.330 --> 00:23:21.580
Ya know, friendship, effort?

00:23:21.790 --> 00:23:24.380
But, ending with pain and stuff?

00:23:24.590 --> 00:23:27.050
Ah, sorry about that.
I got carried away there.

00:23:27.260 --> 00:23:29.880
I'll capture your first win, nice and good...

00:23:30.090 --> 00:23:32.850
So don't keep your
fans waiting, Sakura-<i>chan</i>!

00:23:33.220 --> 00:23:38.220
A request from Sakura:

00:23:33.220 --> 00:23:38.220
There are a lot of pro wrestling moves in "Sekatsuyo,"
but they're dangerous, so please don't try them at home!
